  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Crash Party gatecrasher wave (cp_dial_fight). HOSTILE and killable, unlike cp_loadmob, so the dial produces real COMBAT load - the shape players actually generate. Deliberately pathetic: 8 hp, STR 6, CR 1, so it cannot meaningfully hurt anybody and killing it is worth almost no XP. Carries NOTHING and Lootable=0: a spawned NPC holding anything real is the classic pickpocket duplication bug, and a hostile one would also drop it on death. Tag is cp_load so CLEAR ALL collects it. NO_LEASH=1 (runtime-spawned, no home to return to) satisfies tests/check_spawn_leash.py."
  },
